  "description" : "What if you could actually use a mouse cursor in real life? Takumi, the nerdy outcast, harbours unrequited feelings for his first love, Mone, who treats him with disdain. During computer class, Takumi discovers that his mouse cursor extends beyond the screen and into the physical world...?! With this newfound power visible only to him, Takumi sees an opportunity for mischief. He uses the cursor to get revenge on Mone, clicking on sensitive areas and revelling in her reactions. But when an \"Intercourse\" button appears unexpectedly, Takumi is thrust into a reality he never imagined possible...\"Intercourse\"?! Could this really be...?!\nSource: Coolmic\nNote: The first episode was shown on September 11th at AnimeFesta",
